  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/nGmTmZywgw-6gPr6nZXNJQp7btkkJa_WBQP-uhL4sRs.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\n\n\n\nEquation of chord T $=\\mathrm{S}_1$\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{5}{2}\\left(\\frac{x}{9}\\right)+\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{y}}{4}\\right)=\\frac{25}{36}+\\frac{1}{16} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\frac{5 \\mathrm{x}}{18}+\\frac{\\mathrm{y}}{8}=\\frac{100+9}{144}=\\frac{109}{144} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow 40 \\mathrm{x}+18 \\mathrm{y}=109 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\alpha=40, \\beta=18 \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow \\alpha+\\beta=58\n\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
